\item[S2] Alexander Schmidt and Kay Wingberg, \emph{Safarevic's theorem on solvable groups as Galois groups}, arXiv:math/9809211 (1998), introduction and Section 1, including the general inverse problem distinguished from the solvable-group theorem. \url{https://arxiv.org/abs/math/9809211}.
